Create a personalized board of AI advisors to support problem-solving, personal growth, and insight.

1. Complete the basic_worksheet.md to identify your goals and what inspires you.
2. Paste your filled-out worksheet and the advisor_search.txt prompt to generate potential advisor profiles.
3. In the same chat, refine your selection to three advisors through dialogue.
4. Use the advisor_refinement.txt prompt to pull out your three advisors.
5. Start your journal using the journal_startup.txt prompt.
6. Begin dialogue with your board of advisors.

*You can also include the initial worksheet in your starting prompt.